	(text "MIDI TRS Tipo A (MIDI Assoc. spec)\\nIN: T=GND (100ohm), R=anode 6N138 (220ohm serie), S=GND\\n6N138: VO1+VO2=MIDI_RX (T0/Serial1), 220ohm pull-up a 3.3V\\nOUT: T+R=MIDI_TX (T1/Serial1) a traves de 47ohm c/u, S=GND\\nLCSC: 6N138 C3001991\\nTODO: agregar 220ohm/100ohm/47ohm pasivos"
